  <div slot="take" class="law-take">
    <p class="law-take-h">What governs your community</p>
    <ul class="law-take-ref">
      <li><strong>Chapter 720</strong> — the Homeowners’ Association Act, the main statute for HOAs. Most of this page comes from it.</li>
      <li><strong>Chapter 718</strong> — the Condominium Act. Condominium regimes only, and a heavier set of rules.</li>
      <li><strong>Chapter 617</strong> — the Nonprofit Corporation Act. It steps in wherever 720 or 718 is silent.</li>
